# hermes-homelab egress allowlist — default DENY, this file is what's allowed.
# One domain per line. 'example.com' allows example.com AND *.example.com.
# Lines starting with '#' are comments. Edit live — the proxy reloads on change.
#
# Where the AI creates things / downloads packages from:

# ── AI provider APIs (add YOUR provider's API host if missing) ─────────
# NOTE: the xiaomi/mimo client talks to *.xiaomimimo.com (api.xiaomimimo.com,
# token-plan-sgp.xiaomimimo.com) — NOT api.xiaomi.com. The rule below covers
# all of them; without it EVERY chat call is denied and the agent is unusable.
xiaomimimo.com
googleapis.com
api.openai.com
api.anthropic.com
generativelanguage.googleapis.com
api.deepseek.com
api.mistral.ai
api.groq.com
openrouter.ai
api.together.xyz
api.xiaomi.com
api.mimo.ai

# ── Hermes Agent (installer / updates) ────────────────────────────────
hermes-agent.nousresearch.com

# ── GitHub (git clone, gh, release assets) ────────────────────────────
github.com
githubusercontent.com
githubassets.com
ghcr.io

# ── Python packages ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
pypi.org
pythonhosted.org
files.pythonhosted.org

# ── Node.js packages ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
registry.npmjs.org
nodejs.org
deb.nodesource.com

# ── Debian / Ubuntu packages ──────────────────────────────────────────
deb.debian.org
security.debian.org
deb.ubuntu.com
archive.ubuntu.com
security.ubuntu.com

# ── Rust / Go modules ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
crates.io
static.crates.io
index.crates.io
proxy.golang.org
sum.golang.org
storage.googleapis.com

# ── Model / dataset hubs ──────────────────────────────────────────────
huggingface.co
hf.co

# ── Coding CLIs in the image (opencode, codex, claude, mimo) ───────────
# Login / update endpoints they phone home to. Anything still blocked shows
# up as a DENY line in `docker logs hermes-egress-proxy` — add the host here
# (edits apply live, no restart needed).
opencode.ai
claude.ai
chatgpt.com
auth.openai.com
console.anthropic.com
accounts.google.com

# ── Escape hatch (removes the guard entirely — leave commented out) ───
# *
